<#-- The body of a purchase order email (mantle.order.OrderServices.send#PurchaseOrder): the buyer's note, then the order as
     printed by get#PurchaseOrderPrint, whose PDF is attached; with
     linkUrl, the supplier's own link to the Supplier app (impl-purchasing P16). -->
<#if note><div style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px">
<#list String(note).split('\n') as noteLine>${noteLine}<br></#list>
</div></#if>
<#if linkUrl><p style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px"><a href="${linkUrl}">Open this link</a> to acknowledge this order and send your bill.
The link is yours alone; do not forward it.</p></#if>
${raw(printHtml)}
